OL,3,AWhy UK diesel prices have breached the
OL,4,A#2 per litre mark
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe price of diesel in the UK has
OL,7,Fbreached the #2 per litre mark for the
OL,8,Ffirst time, as the fallout from the
OL,9,FUS-Israel war with Iran continues to
OL,10,Fdrive up costs.
OL,12,FThe average price of a litre of diesel
OL,13,Fat the pump stands at an all-time high
OL,14,Fof 200.01p, according to the RAC
OL,15,Fmotoring body.
OL,17,FOver the past seven months, the Iran
OL,18,Fwar has severely disrupted the
OL,19,Fproduction and transportation of oil
OL,20,Facross the region, causing the price of
OL,21,Ffuels made from crude to surge.
OL,23,APub: 02-MarQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
