OL,3,AWhy UK diesel prices have breached the
OL,4,A#2 per litre mark
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotor fuel prices fell back when the US
OL,7,Fand Iran agreed in June to a framework
OL,8,Fdeal to end the fighting, but rose
OL,9,Fagain as tensions resurfaced.
